  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Used to define the size (width/height) of Grid ColumnDefinition and RowDefinition.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            GridLength of type <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.GridUnitType.Absolute" /> represents exact size.
            GridLength of type <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.GridUnitType.Auto" /> adapts to fit content size.
            GridLength of type <see cref="F:Microsoft.Maui.GridUnitType.Star" /> distributes remaining space proportionally.
            This value type is readonly.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
